    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include lansoprazole as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 182 capsules of the 30 mg presentation with a daily use of 9.6, providing 19 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 255 capsules of the 30 mg presentation with a daily use of 9.2, providing 27.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is Camber Pharmaceuticals, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list and uses Hetero Labs Limited Unit III, last inspected VAI on 2023-07-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The current label for the product in use names A-S Medication Solutions as the registered plant, last inspected VAI on 2026-08-12.",
      "cites": ["E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A-S Medication Solutions received a Warning Letter on 2017-06-05 and its most recent inspection was classified VAI on 2026-08-12.",
      "cites": ["E9", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Buyers should verify that the Camber supply chain remains clear and monitor the A-S Medication Solutions plant for any future regulatory actions.",
